! v1.11.0 Ehrenfest regression 1: the BOMD-limit oracle in time.
! H2/PBE/STO-3G stretched +0.02 A off the optimizer minimum
! (R_eq = 0.73659 A), released at rest.  Full run (240 x 5 au)
! anchors: period 279.28 au vs harmonic 277.25 au (-0.73%, correct
! anharmonic sign); this SHORT version (60 x 5 au ~ one period)
! anchors the conservation and the monitors:
!   max |E_tot - E_tot(0)|  ~ 9.8e-7 Ha
